### Validation and error handling

# Invalid page size: expected 422
GET {{baseUrl}}/sales?page_size=500

###

# Invalid date: expected 422
GET {{baseUrl}}/sales?date_from=2025-13-01

###

# Invalid region: expected 422
GET {{baseUrl}}/sales?region=Mars

###

# Unknown SKU: expected 404
GET {{baseUrl}}/sales?sku_code=UNKNOWN

###

# Invalid grouping: expected 422
GET {{baseUrl}}/sales/summary?group_by=invalid
